@94   = ~Bite~
@95   = ~Mask of Three Sublime Rubies~
@96   = ~This item used to be a burial mask, but when it was found by a curious bard, he turned it into a headgear that could be used by the living to enhance their ability to control magic. Some say that when worn, the rubies whisper secrets and hints regarding everything around the one who wears it.

While it must have been difficult to change it from a burial mask to a normal one, it clearly was worth all the effort and resources.

