@111  = ~Ink Gallery~
@112  = ~The Ink Gallery
I found an interesting place in Athkatla's Government District: The Ink Gallery. If I understood the owner of the place right, it's a place where some powerful tomes are kept; tomes that allow their readers to relive some moments immortalized in the stories and learn from them.~
@113  = ~The Ink Gallery
I've relived and survived a challenge offered by a book titled Tale of Eight-Legged Strider.~
@114  = ~The Ink Gallery
I've relived and survived a challenge offered by a book titled The Birth of the Fury.~
