@124  = ~The Ink Gallery
Viscountess asked me to meet her in the basement of the Ink Gallery. She would like to discuss something with me down there.~
@125  = ~The Ink Gallery
Viscountess asked me to help her investigate The Blood Pages of Bhaal. I told her that I'll think about it.~
@126  = ~The Ink Gallery
I was asked to investigate The Blood Pages of Bhaal, held in the basement of the Ink Gallery in Athkatla. I've accepted the job. Let's see if it's truly as impressive as it seems.~
@127  = ~The Ink Gallery
The Ink Gallery is a place filled with powerful books. I was allowed to learn from them; face all the struggles that were immortalized on their pages. One of them was a tome called The Blood Pages of Bhaal. It showed me scenes and characters from my own story. It was a truly bizarre mission, but I managed to finish the job.~
@128  = ~The Ink Gallery
The Ink Gallery is a place filled with powerful books. I was allowed to learn from them; face all the struggles that were immortalized on their pages. One of them was a tome called The Blood Pages of Bhaal. The Viscountess asked me to help her investigate that book, but I declined the job. She took it pretty well, though.~
@129  = ~Ah, so you're in one piece. I am glad that you survived the battle with the Midwife. Well done!~
@130  = ~(Gained +1 Saving Throw vs. Death/Poison. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@131  = ~You won the battle against our poor swordsman. Well done!~
@132  = ~(Gained Special Ability: Enrage. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@133  = ~(Gained +5% Electric Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@134  = ~I always hated zombies, but... well, you clearly know how to deal with their kind!~
@135  = ~(Gained +3% Magic Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@136  = ~You've slain that titanic thing, hmm? You must admit, that was quite an enormous beast.~
@137  = ~(Gained +5% Fire Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@138  = ~It looks like you're not afraid even of the strongest enemies, like devils!~
@139  = ~(Gained +5 Lore. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@140  = ~(Gained +5% Missile Damage Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@141  = ~Ah, it must have been quite a ball. I wish I could see your performance. Anyway, I'm glad to see you alive.~
@142  = ~(Gained +5% Slashing Damage Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@143  = ~You're back already? Impressive!~
@144  = ~(Gained +2 Hit Points. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@145  = ~This is strange... I felt the book react to you in a strange manner. I'm sorry for that. It must have been some anomaly. I'll investigate this, I promise.~
@146  = ~(Gained +5% Cold Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@147  = ~And here is our hero! Welcome back!~
@148  = ~(Gained +1 Saving Throw vs. Spells. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@149  = ~Ah! I can see you defeated these crazy kobolds! Good!~
@150  = ~(Gained +5% Piercing Damage Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@151  = ~It must have been quite an extermination. Mhm. It's good you survived the attacks.~
@152  = ~(Gained +5% Acid Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@153  = ~So, you defeated the remorhaz, hmm? That must have been quite a challenge!~
@154  = ~(Gained +5% Crushing Damage Resistance. A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@155  = ~(A secret passage to the basement opens... A new souvenir has been added to the Ink Gallery shop.)~
@156  = ~(The main enemy and her minions are dead. You may now leave.)~
@157  = ~(The battle is over. The swordsman is dead and the archon disappeared.)~
@158  = ~(The necromancer and his minions were stopped. You are free to leave.)~
@159  = ~(The creature is dead. You may leave now.)~
@160  = ~(The glabrezu and the bow-wielders were defeated. You may leave this place.)~
@161  = ~(The ball is over. You may leave this place.)~
@162  = ~(The swamps start to shift. Perhaps the sooner you leave, the better.)~
@163  = ~(The Moon Sisters have fallen. You may leave this unusual place.)~
@164  = ~(The monster is gone. You may leave now.)~
@165  = ~(You need to make sure the kobold vampires won't rise again before you can leave this area.)~
@166  = ~(By stabbing the kobolds' hearts with wooden stakes, you open the way out of this realm.)~
@167  = ~(The swarms have been killed, and you survived the attack. You may now leave.)~
@168  = ~(The remorhaz and the elementals are gone.)~
@169  = ~The protrusions on the back of this remorhaz flare up, as if lit by flint on steel, as you draw near.~
@170  = ~Lolth! Let me call your children and the other creeping things, and defeat your enemies! Against all odds!~
@171  = ~(This huge book is looking quite ominous.)~
@172  = ~(The book feels warm when you touch it. Then, suddenly, you feel the ink gather around your hand.)~
@173  = ~(The ink reaches a small cut on your hand and mixes with your blood. Then, you feel the urge to turn the page.)~
@174  = ~(This primitive coffin is empty.)~
@175  = ~(Kobold vampire is regenerating in this coffin. If you have a wooden stake, you may now kill him.)~
@176  = ~(You stab the kobold's heart with a wooden stake, and the little vampire meets its final end.)~
@177  = ~(You need a wooden stake to destroy the kobold vampire.)~
@178  = ~(The little fella is dead.)~
@179  = ~Lava Ankheg~
@180  = ~Spitting Beetle~